    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89780" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσνοέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>observe</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλο τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					2.16
				</span></i>
			 codd.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐν τοῖς ὕδασι γιγνόμενον . . ,
					ὅτι . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.Chr.
					21.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PEnteux.</u>
					30.3
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἐρχόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>To.</u>
					11.6
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., ib. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Jd.</u>
				3.26
			</span></i>: abs., ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Is.</u>
				63.5
			</span></i>; <i>wait attentively for</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ παραγγελλόμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.3.7
				</span></i>
			 codd. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>think in addition</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθεγξάμενος τὸ ἀγαθὸν μηδὲν ἔτι
					προσνόει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					3.8.11
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ λόγῳ τῆς αὐτογραμμῆς οὐκ
					ἔνι προσνοούμενον πέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.6.17
				</span></i>
			.</div>
